    <allowmultiplestdins></allowmultiplestdins>
    <answer><![CDATA[def gas_remaining(gas_limit, costs):
    remaining = gas_limit
    for c in costs:
        if remaining < c:
            return "out of gas"
        remaining -= c
    return remaining
]]></answer>
